{"channelId":"UCB3bvm76tUAno4LBTs2cC0w","row":["Small Door Veterinary",1340,"🧡 🐶 🩺 Small Door is a new kind of veterinary clinic that delivers better care for pets and a better experience for pet parents. \n\nWe offer gold-standard medical care, a shorter wait for appointments, and partnership in your pet’s care, plus 24/7 telehealth for peace of mind. Our veterinary teams are trained in fear-free techniques, and our spaces are designed to be stress-free — so dogs and cats who normally hate vet visits will actually enjoy coming to see us. (Or at least hate it less.)\n\nWe’re proud to be among just 15% of veterinary hospitals in the U.S. to be accredited by the American Animal Hospital Association. This is vet care so good, you’ll ask if we take humans.\n\nSmall Door is currently located in New York City, Washington, DC, and Boston.","hi@smalldoorvet.com",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCB3bvm76tUAno4LBTs2cC0w","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCB3bvm76tUAno4LBTs2cC0w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:19.978Z","channelId":"UCB3bvm76tUAno4LBTs2cC0w","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"220268714e3ac04bf9e1e354748695bda7fa98ea79c86e663f194d45d64a3b0d","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"7524ac7557ca6891f8eec09d8fbc7b6909af7e7805e8722a87402b0bbd6e066d"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCB3bvm76tUAno4LBTs2cC0w","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1340,"raw":"1.34K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCB3bvm76tUAno4LBTs2cC0w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:19.978Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"hi@smalldoorvet.com","purpose":"unknown","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"channel_published","sourceUrls":["https://www.smalldoorvet.com/","https://www.smalldoorvet.com/about-us/","https://www.smalldoorvet.com/team/"],"evidenceIds":["public-page:b5f2efacad20d1da92f3e67f","public-page:c9b962cceda7b41